Affected files: crates/astro_ephem_core/src/models/mod.rs (IAU 2006 precession, IAU 2000B
nutation arguments, ERA/GMST, WGS84), models/nut00b_table.rs, position.rs (light deflection and
aberration formulae).

ΔT data: US Naval Observatory (public domain), models/delta_t_table.rs.
Planetary ephemeris: JPL DE440 (public domain), not redistributed; see data/README.

Star positions for star-based ayanamshas: Hipparcos new reduction (van Leeuwen 2007, ESA),
retrieved via NASA HEASARC (hipnewcat). Galactic Centre: Sgr A* (Reid & Brunthaler 2004).
